plasma-visual-screensaver (0.10.0-1ppa1~resolute1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Add glowing hexagon power-ups to Slithering Snakes, with one effect at
    a time: Surge gives free, back-to-back boosts and a faster snake; Magnet
    pulls in food from three times as far; Phase lets snakes slip through
    rivals' bodies. Turn power-ups off in Settings.
  * Snakes seek power-ups to hunt, scavenge and escape. Show each effect with
    crackling arcs, an orbiting magnet ring or a translucent hologram.
  * Keep OpenGL as the default. Add experimental Vulkan opt-in with
    PVS_GRAPHICS_API=vulkan or --graphics-api vulkan. Vulkan can stall on
    NVIDIA layer-shell overlays.
  * Fix steady memory growth on NVIDIA under Plasma Wayland by working around
    egl-wayland2's queued release events: disable explicit sync, including when
    legacy is installed. Respect user overrides; add --keep-egl-wayland2.

